  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NGO network 2004</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NGO n&#xe4;tverk 2004</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of network of multi ethnic organisations in Macedonia and increasing institutional and human resource capacity in the organisations within the network. The project also contains project funds for the regional centers that exist within the network. The number of centers will be increased from six to eight during 2004.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xe4;rkande av n&#xe4;tverk av multietniska enskilda organisationer i Makedonien och att h&#xf6;ja den institutionella och personella kapaciteten hos de i n&#xe4;tverket ing&#xe5;ende organisationerna. Projektet innefattar &#xe4;ven en pott med projektpengar f&#xf6;r de regionala centra som existerar inom n&#xe4;tverket. Antalet regionala centra kommer att ut&#xf6;kas fr&#xe5;n sex till &#xe5;tta under 2004.</narrative>
  </description>
